# Vercel CLI deploys run from the repo root (dashboard; landing via env override).
# The CLI does NOT read .gitignore — it only skips its fixed default list
# (node_modules, .git, .env.local, .env.*.local, .vercel, .next, …).
# These entries are ADDED on top of that list. (2026-09-29: a deploy took ~10 min
# because .claude/worktrees held 4.7 GB of agent workspaces.)

# Agent workspaces, checkpoints and local tool state
.claude/

# Local previews and generated scratch output (not part of any build)
.preview/
conclave-builder-pack/out/
tools/**/journey-audit-shots/
tools/**/evidence/

# Secrets — never upload, even if one is created locally by mistake
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
*.pem
